-## Downstream Contract Work
+Failures distinguish authentication failure, invalid payload or plot reference, invalid base revision, and idempotency-key reuse. An unknown base or a base from another visit is rejected without altering visit state. A known stale base is accepted and produces review work. Error responses identify the reason so tablet-sync can retain the draft and explain the outcome.
 
